{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your next case, Mr Investigator. That's what she called you. It's business as usual, another misfortune filed at our doorstep. The only difference this time was how particular she felt about handing us the job. She even left a note for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want my advice, just do what you do. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>One of a kind time-traveling detective adventure that will have you piece together through grit and clever deductions; the mysterious cumulation of events leading up to an unresolved murder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Specialist Hire From The Time Bureau.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator</i> is a first-person murder mystery based on evidence analysis and logical deduction.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/fe83dbf6454f909a0c49546502766086.poster.avif?t=1769061172\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/fe83dbf6454f909a0c49546502766086.webm?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/fe83dbf6454f909a0c49546502766086.mp4?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Travel between the days leading up to their death.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Investigate the simulated memories from the victim's diary prior to their death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.poster.avif?t=1769061172\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.webm?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/59f1e35f5b6e10b5b1671bfc4427be39.mp4?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cross examine evidence  to restore the victim's legacy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look carefully, closely and find little details in the environment. Inspect, reinspect and reinspect again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/41e44b57d3cee0ea0edc6349948ea916.poster.avif?t=1769061172\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/41e44b57d3cee0ea0edc6349948ea916.webm?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/41e44b57d3cee0ea0edc6349948ea916.mp4?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your detective intuition to piece together the truth behind the murder.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only solution is your keen ability for insight and piecing together critical evidence.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/9849387ace95d58cfea7c40595b50f57.poster.avif?t=1769061172\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/9849387ace95d58cfea7c40595b50f57.webm?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/9849387ace95d58cfea7c40595b50f57.mp4?t=1769061172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Created by Haoning Wu</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1769061172","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816830?t=1769061172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/7b9d6b75c3771489801a8dbcd59cf1fbb7c1a079/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769061172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/7b9d6b75c3771489801a8dbcd59cf1fbb7c1a079/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769061172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains stylized depictions of violence and investigation themes. Includes mature elements involving loss, grief, and illness that may be distressing for some players."},"demos":[{"appid":4130380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Your next case, Mr Investigator. That's what she called you. It's business as usual, another misfortune filed at our doorstep. The only difference this time was how particular she felt about handing us the job. She even left a note for you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want my advice, just do what you do. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>One of a kind time-traveling detective adventure th